Scope of this license

The MIT license above covers original work in this repository:
  matlab/         MATLAB code (GUI, backends, runners, tests, utilities)
  scripts/        Python + shell helpers (YAML generator, build scripts, test runner)
  benchmarks/     YAML benchmark specifications and analytic + external fixtures
  docs/           Documentation
  figures/        Auto-generated validation figures

It does NOT cover the following third-party materials which are packaged
alongside for convenience but retain their original licenses:

  pfem/            The Fortran source and datasets of "Programming the Finite
                   Element Method" (Smith, Griffiths, Margetts; 5th edition, Wiley,
                   2014). Distributed under the terms set by the textbook authors
                   at http://www.pfem.org.uk/. Not redistributed under MIT.
                   Users should obtain the PFEM source directly from the textbook
                   authors and apply the patches in scripts/pfem_patches/ locally.
                   The pfem/ directory is gitignored in this repository.

  scripts/pfem_patches/
                   Small patches (adding USE geom declarations, allocating UMAT
                   arrays, providing a Lanczos solver, etc.) that make the
                   textbook source compile cleanly on Linux gfortran. These are
                   original work covered by the MIT license above and are
                   provided as diffs to be applied to the user's own copy of the
                   PFEM source.
